description:
Normalize table representation, taxonomy grouping, identifier typing, and the
separation of source text from compiler-authored labels.

Required membership — all of:
- restore madness-table duration semantics (durations were dropped);
- preserve optional qualifiers, and mark synthesized headers as synthesized
  (table:scrying "Basis"/"Circumstance");
- normalize empty table cells — the pack currently stores both "" (484
  occurrences) and "—" (88 occurrences) for the same concept;
- preserve Tack, Harness, and Drawn Vehicles grouping, and the Barding
  transformation;
- type tool / skill / language / proficiency identifiers consistently instead of
  free text;
- unify damage amount field shapes (flat vs dice field names differ across
  record kinds);
- distinguish source text from compiler-authored labels throughout.

Closes findings: F-10, F-13, F-14, F-16, F-17, F-34, SOL-012, CAP-013, Fable F5,
Fable F6, Fable F7.
